# Synthetic movie (scripts/make_bk2.py, VBL-keyed): from --skip-to-level
# sunny_villa, Start at VBL 1700, Down twice and Cross open Options, Cross
# on Save Game, then Cross every 90 VBLs from 1960 to 2860: on a blank
# formatted card the options overlay creates the save block and writes the
# save (pause menu back at VBL 2945). Down four times and Cross pick Exit
